{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"36da215564015fe72dba298e90488ad046dac6ce262690242b7b7728fc2d1a12","ja":"犯人は未来！？","zh":"犯人是未来！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"da591a8d1a1b34c32b495cf1f2bbec39d7a4f443f9cc10ed2f3f3ea182d39f7a","ja":"ゲームは佳境に入り、\nいよいよ解決パートになって……","zh":"游戏进入了关键阶段，\n终于到了揭开谜底的部分……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"5b03b3c0d7379ae31b5891fb8adc44738c9d1023a9bc9e3485ee4067b3a9f0ad","ja":"犯人は……お前だ～っ！！","zh":"犯人就是……你——！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"aa173962232b079459e752fbd0c316cfd5a48c17d1230c4d972b099e82861763","ja":"「くっ……まさかこんなお気楽な奴に\n俺のトリックを見破られるなんて……」","zh":"“可恶……没想到我的诡计竟然会被这么没心没肺的家伙识破……”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"c9a7d76978bb4806e83a31ad580e039d5d01df7027d7f880e2b5d46fd68ee756","ja":"やったー！　私の推理、当たってた～！\nあの女の子、やっぱり犯人じゃなかったんだ！","zh":"太好了！我的推理果然没错～！\n那个女孩果然不是犯人！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"0400f5da629e4673b687fcf722ad11afdbf9b18f47112923cdfc53adf9cc8639","ja":"すごい！　よく当てられたね、未来！","zh":"好厉害！未来，你猜得真准！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"30f02e67a99e83a5d58bd902c47cd7674b0c33ff9ea85d456a8105cc496ef496","ja":"でへへへ～♪　カンが当たっただけだけどね♪\nあっ、このゲーム、まだ続きがあるんだね。","zh":"嘿嘿嘿～♪ 只是碰巧猜中了而已啦♪\n啊，这个游戏还没结束呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"28674ae894fd9d955f4c53bb90a179662e430fd097a61bc42e51d335a5f0a08b","ja":"このあとは第2章で、また次の事件が起こるんだけど、\n今日はここまでかな！","zh":"接下来将在第2章发生新的事件，不过今天就到这里吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"2bbd847c1cd6785aee1b74cc252f4b3fd3c80f0730e0a4bf0b397787962cb30a","ja":"未来、ここまでプレイした感想はどうだった？","zh":"未来，玩到这里感觉怎么样？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"c9d837188f8a17d8f062ac0fb118eedf58e849476fa1f1e6456bd3269dc9e6ce","ja":"すっごく楽しかったよ♪\nアクションはドキドキだったし！","zh":"特别开心哦♪\n动作场面也让人心跳加速！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"f0673228186afc4d040efc9bcc2e287f37ebbfe56321acc070bc7b9d43f384d4","ja":"推理はちょっと難しかったけど、\n謎が解けた時はゾクゾクしちゃった！","zh":"推理虽然有点难，但解开谜题的时候真让人兴奋不已！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"3567c7ed9c665d124014416c7d80c9e42dbb7940764bfbe4f053c78916096330","ja":"推理ものの面白いとこだよね！\n杏奈もすごく楽しかったよ！","zh":"这就是推理作品有趣的地方吧！\n杏奈也觉得特别开心！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"bfce9b9aba17fccb2c46a93a8d17101a4b67d4376ad9e529cf333c401436198a","ja":"でも、続きが気になるな～！\n自分でも買って、プレイしてみようかな～。","zh":"不过，我还真想知道接下来会怎样啊～！\n要不要我也自己买来玩玩看呢～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"fc90c60c314ea846ae845c252dac70ae616550e7f1df2c2a2d14e66794c625f7","ja":"本当？　それじゃあ、\nどっちが速くクリアするか、競争しちゃう？","zh":"真的吗？那要不要比比看谁先通关？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"23c3b3b4b9937ea9ddf5eba07b1867606a61d2ec5c4ed317d65889bc4d8dc8aa","ja":"杏奈もまだ、ここまでしかプレイしてないから、\nどっちが名探偵か勝負するの！","zh":"杏奈也还只玩到这里，所以要来比比谁才是名侦探！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"e7debda4a5e8339a24dd0a76b9bf78744ef4ccae3ac8cd49cdb46493807b22b4","ja":"わあ、面白そう！\nよーし！　負けないぞ～！","zh":"哇，看起来很有意思！\n好——！我不会输的～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"900a9924b9dc8278b24768c3e40e9eb909f69910f28b23c7e9229d6c1b34283f","ja":"誰よりも早く事件を起こして、\nすぐに解決しちゃうんだから！","zh":"要比任何人都更快引发事件，然后马上解决掉！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"5082853fcf376d3e8dd4b9d3c905dd6444f8b9efe66685b9875d20b93d34ea07","ja":"事件を起こすの？\nそれじゃあ、未来が犯人になっちゃうよ！","zh":"要闹出事件吗？\n那样的话，未来就要变成犯人了！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1803.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"a14ce65b8e2cc4dfbb4ce85a4e14809363a335574a44568905d2800a1e1d44a5","ja":"ええ～っ！？　ち、違うよ！\nちょっと間違えただけだから～！","zh":"诶～！？不、不是那样！\n只是稍微弄错了一下啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:01:01+00:00"}
